NotoSansCJKsc-Bold-labels.otf

A subset of Noto Sans CJK SC Bold, version 2.004, from
https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk (Sans/OTF/SimplifiedChinese).
Copyright 2014-2021 Adobe (http://www.adobe.com/), with Reserved Font
Name 'Source'. Noto is a trademark of Google Inc. It is licensed under
the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1, in OFL.txt beside this file.

It holds only the glyphs of the Simplified Chinese territory labels, so
it stays a few kilobytes. Go Bold, from golang.org/x/image, draws every
other language. When a label needs a glyph this file lacks, the glyph
test in internal/territory fails; make the subset again with every
glyph the labels need, for example with fontTools:

  python3 -m fontTools.subset NotoSansCJK-Bold.ttc --font-number=2 \
    --text=" 小中大型未知" --layout-features='' \
    --output-file=NotoSansCJKsc-Bold-labels.otf

Font number 2 of the collection is the SC face.
